      "The close note records what was checked, who approved it, what changed, and what would reopen the case. The delivery owner should be able to read one record later and explain the close without contacting the original coordinator. Outsourced Service keeps the client onboarding calls close note with the source evidence. Keep the source, the date observed, the named owner, and the next check with the record. The service review links the reported measure to the source ticket export."
